+| GET | `/api/test-users/templates` | List captured templates. Returns `{templates: [ …same shape + qa_users_bound ]}` |
+| DELETE | `/api/test-users/templates/<template_id>` | 400 unless `template_id` starts with `qatest_` (never deletes a real league). Removes the `qatest_` `leagues` + `league_members` + `member_rankings` rows AND every `qa_*` user bound to it (their full row set), evicting their live sessions. Returns `{ok, template_id, deleted: {member_rankings, league_members, leagues, qa_users, sessions_evicted}}` |
